-- User Dashboard Dynamic Tabs aliases.
-- Purpose: make the existing tenant growth dashboard product layer explicit as the
-- user-facing dashboard contract. The dashboard remains backed by Activation
-- Dynamic Tabs, growth dashboard profile registries, and cursor-loaded details.
-- Additive only: registers tenant-safe endpoint tools and does not expose SQL or secrets.

